+### Archive projection yields to foreground
+
+Native ingress defers new archive-profile projection commands while queued or
+in-flight sends exist, required consumers still have unacked events, or event
+activity is newer than two seconds. The oldest pending projection batch still
+advances after sixty seconds so archive work cannot starve. Bot receive does
+not wait for `message.committed`.
